-- Quest reward items restored for the Luferson / El Morad / Eslant line quests
-- (docs/QUEST_AUDIT.md, "Weapon / accessory rewards").
--
-- The server copy of item_exchange lost the reward ITEMS of many class-split line
-- quests: the output columns hold only EXP (or nothing at all), while the client
-- Item_Exchange.tbl (the table the quest reward window is built from) lists the
-- weapons / rings / earrings / pendants / belts. RunQuestExchange therefore paid EXP
-- only and the quest was completed without the weapon or accessory.
--
--   * Wolf / Orc / Clarence weapon quests (Jalk/Melverick 888-895, Cheina/Kape
--     953-959, Clarence 214-221), Della/Elrod 148-155 and Ascetic Veda 493-496
--     (the latter two had EMPTY outputs),
--   * accessory quests of Teils/Rucel (earring 1122-1129, pendant 1130-1137) and
--     Cheina/Kape (ring 1106-1113, belt 1114-1121).
--
-- Each row gets the client's reward items back. EXP / gold that the server row paid
-- is kept, except where the matching item_exchange_exp choice row already pays the
-- same EXP (it would be paid twice). Absolute UPDATEs by primary key: re-running is
-- a no-op. The exchange_item_time* columns are not touched.

